  (text "Traced from photos of board KB3151C (XWW speed controller, 110-120V 1.0A)."
    (at 20.32 125.73 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid bdfde437-307d-4f55-b2ef-ca5fe852ecfe))
  (text "Timing: MT2 -> RV1 pin-1 section, in parallel with (RV2 + RV1 pin-3 section) -> wiper -> R2 -> C2 -> MT1."
    (at 20.32 129.54 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid f60e0bc7-1d31-45a8-b50b-09d119f7868d))
  (text "C2 voltage fires D1 through R1 into the gate. R3 + C1 are the snubber across the triac."
    (at 20.32 133.35 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1969cddd-8e27-4ffc-a8c1-ecc9ef69dfcd))
  (text "RV2 lies across RV1's whole track (pin 1 to pin 3). RV1 off zone at the pin-3 end: wiper open, no firing."
    (at 20.32 137.16 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid cf358c09-af57-4181-b51f-f90ebccf3c3b))
  (text "   Moving toward pin 1, R falls toward 0 and speed rises; RV2 caps R (sets the slowest speed) just past the off zone."
    (at 20.32 140.97 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2df61007-62ee-48f8-b4bd-919cb23af253))
  (text "VERIFY: RV2 wiper tied to its pin-3 end; RV1 pin-1 and R3 to the MT2 tab; which RV1 pin is the wiper."
    (at 20.32 144.78 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid f9006732-15b8-4572-96e7-96cb1d86a255))
  (text "Q1 tab is MT2 (live). J1/J2 are the spade tabs; the board is a 2-terminal switch in series with the motor."
    (at 20.32 148.59 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 44371266-a04a-4ab4-ae15-58d985aa708c))
